  "display_title": "Possessed Doctor Kada",
  "description": "Hua Tuo, the highest-ranking Chinese doctor of the late Han Dynasty, is possessed by a modern-day surgical intern!\n\n“It’s so vain.” Hua-bu, who was known as a divine doctor, dies in prison from a curse that wasn’t a curse of Cao Cao…\n\n *“Is he still alive?”*\n\nWhen he opens his eyes in excruciating pain, what he sees are… unfamiliar objects and letters he’s never seen before! \n\n*“W-what’s going on? Am I, am I possessed by the body of a doctor from another world?”*\n\nMemories of the body’s owner, Lee Min-Ho, flood into Hua Tuo’s mind. No matter how different the world is, how on earth does a world like this exist…! \n\n*“Who summoned me into the body of this young man?”*\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
